      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I fully agree.\nBut I think it should only be visible when you open the Quick menu.\nAnd there should be an option to also see how big someones mirror is not just were it is.\nIt's consistent with the camera. Why can I see someones camera but not someones mirror.",
